Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool1"}

Thought: Test the best single model strategy with rf, which is top in error table.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a trimmed_mean over the full model pool to see if trimming improves robustness beyond pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"trimmed_mean","pool":"pool_full","trim_pct":0.2}

Thought: Test a median combination on pool2 to see if adding ONLY_FT_catboost improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool2"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over pool3 to see if a more sophisticated distance‑based combination can beat the robust median pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Evaluate a median combination over pool3 to see if adding CWT_catboost improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"median","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter over the smaller, more stable pool1 to see if a more flexible aggregation improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool1","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using the existing handle w1 on the full model pool to see if meta-weighting improves over median.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","weights":"w1","pool":"pool_full"}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy on a strong model (rf) to see if single model beats robust combos.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"rf"}

Thought: Test a DTW barycenter on pool2 to see if adding ONLY_FT_catboost improves performance.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool2","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test a best_single strategy using catboost, which has second best RMSE overall and may outperform rf for this series.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse error weights on pool1 to see if it beats the median pool1 baseline.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a plain mean of the more diverse pool3 to see if the added CWT_catboost improves robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"mean","pool":"pool3"}

Thought: Try a weighted combination over pool3 using inverse_error weights to see if adding CWT_catboost helps robustness.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool3","weights":"inverse_error"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination on pool1 using the pooled_meta_model handle w1 to see if a more sophisticated weighting improves over median pool1.

Action: evaluate_strategy

Action Input: {"combine":"weighted","pool":"pool1","weights":"w1"}

